SUMMARY:MIH Benefit Concert at St. Matthias Episcopal
DESCRIPTION:Men in Harmony\n**A beautiful church and wonderful 4-part a’
  Cappella harmony singing!**\n\n**St. Matthias Episcopal Church** is a par
 ish founded in 1865 as the **Freedmen's Church**\, St. Matthias believes i
 tself to be the oldest [African-American congregation](https://en.wikipedi
 a.org/wiki/Black_church "Black church") in the city.\n**A freewill offerin
 g will be taken and all concert proceeds will go to the care and support o
 f St. Matthias Church\, our Men In Harmony weekly rehearsal location. A sm
 all group will supply music for the 11am service and we will all gather at
  3pm for a 4pm concert and with socializing afterwards.**\n\nPLEASE SEE NO
 TES ABOUT PARKING\n\n[More about St. Matthias](https://stmatthiasepiscopal
 .org)
